-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Planked\">~$24.78/stud</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.75.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">February 1st, 2025</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Obtainable</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The Windswept Pine Tree (cased to WindSwept Pine in game) is a windswept tree ubiquitous to the <a href=\"/wiki/Acidlands\" title=\"Acidlands\">Acidlands</a>. Other trees that can be found alongside the Windswept Pine Trees are the <a href=\"/wiki/Willow\" title=\"Willow\">Willow</a> Trees.\n</p><p>In characteristics, it is mainly grey in colour, specifically of the hex code #505050. Its tree form has rather unique leaves, with them being of a darker colour and its shape form being \"windswept\", hence the tree's name. The tree's textures are the default texture used in most common trees.\n</p><p>Along with most items in the game, the Windswept Pine tree can be used to fill <a href=\"/wiki/Schematics\" title=\"Schematics\">schematics</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Blueprint\" title=\"Blueprint\">blueprints</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Availability\">Availability</span></h2>\n<p>It is accessible by the use of <a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Axe\" title=\"Steel Axe\">Steel Tools</a>, notably the <a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Axe\" title=\"Steel Axe\">Steel Axe</a> and the <a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Saw\" title=\"Steel Saw\">Steel Saw</a>.\n</p>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible\" style=\"background:#291F1D; width:100%; padding:.1em; margin:.5em auto; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\" data-expandtext=\"Open\" data-collapsetext=\"Close\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:105px; background:#140401; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\"><span style=\"float:left; padding-left:10px; padding-top:4px; font-size:90%\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Template:Windswept Pine (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGVtcGxhdGU6V2luZHN3ZXB0X1BpbmU/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\"><span title=\"View this template\">v</span></span> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template_talk:Windswept_Pine\"><span title=\"Discuss this template\">d</span></a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Windswept_Pine?action=edit\"><span title=\"Edit this template\">e</span></a></span><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oaklands\" title=\"Oaklands Wiki\"><img alt=\"Oaklands Wiki\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"115\" height=\"31\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Site-logo.png\" data-image-key=\"Site-logo.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e6/Site-logo.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/115?cb=20221025233312\" /></a><figcaption>Oaklands Wiki</figcaption></figure>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:0; margin:0\">\n<table class=\"navbox\" style=\"border-